msgstr "请求已发送，正在等待模组实读验证…"

msgid "Lock state refreshed"
msgstr "锁定状态已刷新"

msgid "Cell selected: %s / PCI %s. It has not been applied yet."
msgstr "已选择小区：%s / PCI %s，尚未应用锁定。"

msgid "The modem did not report the requested lock state. The operation was not confirmed."
msgstr "模组未返回请求的锁定状态，本次操作未确认成功。"

msgid "Band lock applied and verified"
msgstr "频段锁定已应用并验证成功"

msgid "Cell lock applied and verified"
msgstr "小区锁定已应用并验证成功"

msgid "All supported bands restored and state refreshed"
msgstr "已恢复全部支持频段，状态已刷新"

msgid "Cell lock cleared and state refreshed"
msgstr "小区锁定已清除，状态已刷新"

msgid "Serving and neighbor cell candidates"
msgstr "服务小区与邻区候选"

msgid "Passive AT+ECELL measurements. Match ARFCN and PCI before applying a cell lock."
msgstr "来自 AT+ECELL 的被动测量；应用小区锁之前请核对 ARFCN 与 PCI。"

msgid "This page uses the modem vendor RIL. Changes may interrupt service. Restore defaults if the modem cannot register."
msgstr "本页使用模组厂商 RIL；修改会短暂中断业务。若模组无法注册，请恢复默认设置。"

msgid "Select at least one LTE band and one NR band."
msgstr "LTE 与 NR 均须至少选择一个频段。"

msgid "Applying a band lock interrupts mobile data while the modem re-registers. Band lock and cell lock must not be enabled at the same time."
msgstr "应用频段锁会在模组重新注册时中断移动数据；频段锁与小区锁不能同时启用。"

msgid "A wrong cell lock can disconnect mobile data. Verify the ARFCN and PCI in the serving/neighbor list first."
msgstr "错误的小区锁会导致移动数据断开；请先在服务小区/邻区列表中核对 ARFCN 与 PCI。"

msgid "The modem returned cell data, but no NR-ARFCN could be identified safely."
msgstr "模组返回了小区数据，但无法安全识别 NR-ARFCN。"

msgid "Serving cell / Neighbor cells"
msgstr "主小区 / 邻区"

