msgid "Tap a serving or neighbor cell to fill ARFCN and PCI automatically. ARFCN identifies the channel; PCI identifies the physical cell."
msgstr "点击主小区或邻区即可自动填写；ARFCN 是频道号，PCI 是物理小区标识。"

msgid "Unavailable"
msgstr "模组未提供"

msgid "Raw MT6990 engineering output is retained so LTE/NR band, ARFCN, PCI and neighbor records are not lost by an incorrect parser."
msgstr "保留 MT6990 原始工程信息，以免错误解析导致 LTE/NR 频段、ARFCN、PCI 和邻区记录丢失。"

